NEGATIVE CONTROL (holds in every branch): Potts on the SAME relabeled alignment
  is exactly invariant, max|dS| ~ 1e-14 (Proposition 2). A large delta_LL therefore
  does NOT mean the coevolutionary computation is impossible on that input -- only
  that THIS model finds the input unfamiliar. Never write delta_LL as 'the task got
  harder'.

